# The browser-runnable copies of the documentation examples: build output of
# EngrCAD.DocsGen, picked up by the WebAssembly demo's publish as ordinary static assets.
# The COMMITTED artifact of that pass is docs/examples/live-examples.json, which the site
# reads to decide which screenshots get a Run button.
samples/EngrCAD.WebDemo/wwwroot/examples/
